<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1: </span>The failed process 1 impedes the propagation of data in the
tree phase. Arrow labels show the values of which processes
are included in the respective message along the path.</figcaption>
</figure>
